  unitName: Erza Scarlet (Omni)
  unitId: 840548
  unitNumber: 8339
  description: The best female wizard in Fairy Tail, Erza Scarlet. Her ability is
    to switch weapons and armor instantly to allow her to fight effectively in hand-to-hand
    combat. Her armor was made by ateliers for a brand popular among young women.
    Despite their reluctance at first, her request for them to craft her uniquely
    stylish armor was intimidating enough for them to accede to her demands.
  summonDesc: Listen, if you never want to lose to anyone, you must first accept
    your own weaknesses. And don't forget to always be kind.
  fusionDesc: The path I've chosen alongside my friends makes the future seem brighter.
    I don't fear anything now!
  evoDesc: What's important isn't the magic one has! It's the heart of the wielder
    that matters most!
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
